      "originalText": "If you look at this roles closely,\nyou will notice my users k.sithu can assume\nbelow roles as AmazonEKSClusterAdminPolicy\n\nmeaning --> I can manage certain eks resources for controlplane  \n\narn:aws:iam::173310766280:user/k.sithu\n\n",
